;②キャラ紹介文を書き込み
;##################################################################################
;Hasn't met
IF !CFLAG:102:18
	PRINTFORML Demon god of of %HIS_HER(102)% own world, Makai.
	PRINTFORML An %AllTechLevels(FactionTech:9)% society where magic and technological advancements meet into one place.
	PRINTL
	PRINTFORML %HES_SHES(102,1)% cheerful and matronly, but there is something off about %HIM_HER(102)%.
	PRINTFORML On the other hand, %HE_SHE(102)% also shows %HIS_HER(102)% sociopathic and demonic tendencies at times.
	;条件を記述する部分へ飛ぶ
	GOTO 次のシナリオ登場の条件
ENDIF

;第1章
IF CFLAG:102:3102 == -1
	;「第1章　はじめまして」
	IF CHAPTER_攻略中_K102(0)
		FONTSTYLE 1
		PRINTFORML 「Chapter 1　%K102_ChapterNames(0)%」
		FONTREGULAR
		PRINTFORML %CALLNAME:102% coincidentally crosses paths with you and strikes a caring introduction.
		PRINTFORML Having found that %HE_SHE(102)% needed, a human from the outside world, %HE_SHE(102)% tells you you can meet %HIM_HER(102)% at Makai.
		PRINTFORML Being how Makai is a contrived, complicated, and hard to access world, you'll have to find a way to get to Makai.
		PRINTFORML %HE_SHE(102)% then offers you a choice to start gaining %HIS_HER(102)% trust and get to Makai easily:
		PRINTFORML She'll start with a little tour of Makai, letting you know where to go.
		PRINTL
		PRINTFORML If you deny %HIS_HER(102)% offer— the story ends, you do whatever you want to do and believe whatever you want to believe.
		PRINTFORML If you follow %HIS_HER(102)% lead— you stay in Wonderland, and %HE_SHE(102)%'ll show you how deep %HIS_HER(102)% rabbit hole goes.
		;条件を記述する部分へ飛ぶ
		GOTO 次のシナリオ登場の条件
	ENDIF
	IF CHAPTER_攻略中_K102(10000)
		;レアルートは色を変えてみる
		CALL M_KOJO_COLOR_K102
		FONTSTYLE 1
		PRINTFORML 「Chapter 1　%K102_ChapterNames(110000)%」
		FONTREGULAR
		PRINTFORML Having made a deal with the devil, you decieded to sacrifice your potty training to %CALLNAME:102% and take the incontinence chip.
		PRINTFORML While your bladder and bowels believe you made a really bad choice, 
		RESETCOLOR
		;条件を記述する部分へ飛ぶ
		GOTO 次のシナリオ登場の条件
	ENDIF
	IF CHAPTER_攻略中_K102(10010)
		;レアルートは色を変えてみる
		CALL M_KOJO_COLOR_K102
		FONTSTYLE 1
		PRINTFORML 「Chapter 1　%K102_ChapterNames(110010)%」
		FONTREGULAR
		PRINTFORML Placeholder
		RESETCOLOR
		;条件を記述する部分へ飛ぶ
		GOTO 次のシナリオ登場の条件
	ENDIF	
ENDIF

;第2章
IF CFLAG:102:3103 == -1
	IF CHAPTER_攻略中_K102(10)
		FONTSTYLE 1
		PRINTFORML 「Chapter 2　%K102_ChapterNames(200010)%」
		FONTREGULAR
		PRINTFORML Deceived by %CALLNAME:102% into having a messy yet magical accident, you have inherited %CALLNAME:102%'s item summoning powers because of it.
